Package: nbzinbJia
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression
    via IRLS and EM
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Fangxu", "Jia", , "jiafangxu@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial regression by iteratively reweighted
    least squares alternated with Newton-Raphson updates for the
    dispersion parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial regression
    by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits.
